OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper says #1.2bn data centre
OL,4,Awill boost city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has defended plans for a
OL,7,F#1.2bn data centre on the edge of a
OL,8,Fcity, insisting it will benefit the
OL,9,Farea despite thousands of objections.
OL,11,FMatt Bartram, chief executive of
OL,12,FNorwich Apex Ltd, said the scheme
OL,13,Fopposite Tesco Harford Bridge on the
OL,14,FA140 could help turn Norwich into a
OL,15,F"tech hub" amid a booming demand for
OL,16,Fartificial intelligence (AI).
OL,18,FHis team wants to create one of the
OL,19,FUK's "greenest data centres" despite
OL,20,Fcampaigners claiming it would have
OL,21,F"terrible consequences" for
OL,22,Fneighbouring wildlife sites.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
